{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝、ZIP!でプチプチの中に\nたまーにハートがあるってやってて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレゼントを包んでるプチプチを見て\n一生懸命探してました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見当たらず。そんな簡単じゃないよね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことで\nみなさんからのプレゼント受けとりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/04/0684193/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、\n『嫌われ松子の一生』を観に行ってました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「赤い熱情篇」、「黒い孤独篇」\n両方とも観させてもらいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/04/0684193/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日連続観たけど\n全然 終わった後の感想が違ったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の京都の個別の時に\nあのシーンすごいよね！とか\nあのシーン好きなの！とか\n二人にめっちゃ語ってたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネタバレになるから言えない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/04/0684193/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ言いたい～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観る人によっても変わってくると思うけど\n中田的な感想は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香は鳥肌がたって\n若は発狂したくなった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず\n感じ方？というか心に残るもの？が違う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちもすごく良かったので\n是非、両方とも観てみてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/04/0684193/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/04/0684193/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「別冊カドカワ 総力特集 乃木坂46 vol.03」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日発売されました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"連載中の『中田選抜選定委員会』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は\nいろんなアイドルの話をしてるので\n一概には言えません、というより\nこういうアイドルもありますって感じで\n読んでいただけると嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/04/0684193/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この話はどこの現場の話だなー\nって考えながら観るのもありですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田が好きなアイドルがバレますが。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことで\n今回もまるごと乃木坂なので熟読してね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/04/0684193/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}